{"product_id":"voopoo-argus-z-17w-pod-system","title":"Voopoo Argus Z 17W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the VOOPOO Argus Z 17W Pod System, offering a 900mAh battery, 17W max wattage output, and is compatible with all Argus Z Replacment Pods. Constructed from durable aluminum-alloy, the chassis of the VOOPOO Argus Z offers a small and portable form factor, allowing the Argus Z to easily fit into the pocket, purse, or bookbag. The Voopoo Argus Z is perfect for those that are constantly on-the-go or traveling. Paired natively with the 0.7ohm Argus POD cartridge, the Argus Z can also be paired up with any other Argus POD cartridge to deliver delicious flavor and vapor from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"voopoo argus z pod system infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/files\/Voopoo_Argus_Z_Infographic.jpg?v=1674520274\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVOOPOO Argus Z 17W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 91mm by 27.5mm by 14.8mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: Built-In 900mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Wattage Output: 17W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Range: 3.2-3.5V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.5-3.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Aluminum-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Draw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: Argus Z Pod Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Side Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvertime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u